surjective with kernel `2 ℤ[q]^ℕ`, and `𝔽₂[q]^ℕ` is not a domain (`q⁵ + q + 1` is idempotent
modulo `(2, P₃)`). -/
example : Function.Surjective (mapRing ℤ Set.univ (Int.castRingHom (ZMod 2))) ∧
