/-- Test `cycloModuleCompletion.not_directSum` (non-example): for `M = ⊕_ℕ ℤ`, the element
`Σ_j e_j P_j` is not in the image of `M ⊗ ℤ[q]^ℕ = ⊕_j ℤ[q]^ℕ`. -/
